        (Ax_TraceabilityClosure scope) directly -- this is NOT a DS
        dispatch, it's a governance read of DS's findings. Only after #3
        is decided does step_2 fire.",
    blocks: ["#3", "#5 (informed by #3's decision)", "step_2 dispatch"],
  },

  step_2_dispatch_lxc104_fix: {
